
Composite: When I navigate to the website homepage
When I wait until element located by `caseSensitiveText(Swag Labs)` appears
Then `${current-page-url}` is equal to `https://www.saucedemo.com/`


Composite: When I log in as a Good User
When I enter `${swagGoodUserName}` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id="user-name"])`
And I enter `${swagPassword}` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id="password"])`
And I click on element located by `xpath(//*[@id="login-button"])`

Composite: When I log in as a Broken User
When I enter `${swagBrokenUserName}` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id="user-name"])`
And I enter `${swagPassword}` in field located by `xpath(//input[@id="password"])`
And I click on element located by `xpath(//*[@id="login-button"])`
